@@s030 At the exam
@@s031 When you write the time of an algorithm on graphs, declare which structure you use and why. Ready phrase: <i>"We store the graph as adjacency lists, so the space is O(n + m) and scanning the neighbours of a vertex costs O(degree)."</i>
